SSInvitationAgent(8)        System Manager's Manual       SSInvitationAgent(8)

NAME
     SSInvitationAgent – Screen Sharing Invitation Agent

DESCRIPTION
     SSInvitationAgent notifies the current user that a request to view the
     screen has been received.

     The SSInvitationAgent command should not be run directly.

